---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import SiteShell from "../layouts/SiteShell.astro";

const getEntrySlug = (entry) => entry.slug ?? entry.id.replace(/\.(mdoc|mdx?)$/, "");
// frontmatter 裸日期按 UTC 午夜解析，格式化必须用 UTC 取值，否则西半球时区会提前一天
const formatDate = (date) => date.toISOString().slice(0, 10);

const allPosts = (await getCollection("blog"))
  .filter((post) => !post.data.draft)
  .sort((a, b) => b.data.pubDate.valueOf() - a.data.pubDate.valueOf());
const recentPosts = allPosts.slice(0, 5);

const projects = (await getCollection("projects"))
  .sort((a, b) => a.data.order - b.data.order);
---

<SiteShell
  title="Yoryon | 个人主页"
  description="Yoryon（釉蓝yoryon）的个人主页：AI 产品、LLM 应用、Agent 工作流与模型评测的思考、写作和项目实践。"
  activeNav="home"
  bodyClass="home-particle-page"
>
  <main class="home-main">
    <section class="hero" id="home" aria-label="首页介绍">
      <canvas class="hero-particles" data-particle-field aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
      <nav class="hero-nav" aria-label="首屏导航">
        <a href="#about" data-flicker-text>ABOUT</a>
        <a href="#projects" data-flicker-text>PROJECTS</a>
        <a href="#thinking" data-flicker-text>THINKING</a>
        <a href="#contact" data-flicker-text>CONTACT</a>
      </nav>
      <div class="hero-brand-block">
        <h1 class="hero-wordmark" data-flicker-text>Yoryon</h1>
        <p class="hero-manifesto" data-flicker-text>我们已经越过事件视界<br />起飞已经开始</p>
        <p class="hero-sub" data-flicker-text>We are past the event horizon;<br />the takeoff has started.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="hero-location" data-flicker-text>BUPT<br />AI Product<br />Beijing, China</p>
      <a class="hero-scroll" href="#about" data-flicker-text>SCROLL &darr;</a>
    </section>

    <section class="section about-section" id="about" data-particle-morph-trigger>
      <div class="container about-layout">
        <header class="about-heading">
          <h2 class="about-title is-flicker-paused" data-flicker-text data-flicker-on-view>ABOUT ME</h2>
        </header>

        <div class="about-principle">
          <h3 class="about-principle-title is-flicker-paused" data-flicker-text data-flicker-on-view>Philosophy</h3>
          <p class="about-principle-label reveal">[ PRINCIBLE ]</p>
          <p class="about-manifesto">
            <span class="about-manifesto-line is-flicker-paused" data-flicker-text data-flicker-on-view>Invert</span>
            <span class="about-manifesto-line is-flicker-paused" data-flicker-text data-flicker-on-view>always invert</span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-profile reveal" aria-label="Personal profile">
          <p class="about-profile-kicker">Born in 2004</p>
          <p class="about-profile-name">Yoryon</p>
          <p class="about-profile-details">
            <span>Information and</span>
            <span>Computing Science</span>
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-narrative reveal">
          <p class="about-narrative-label">[ WHO I AM ]</p>
          <div class="about-narrative-columns">
            <div class="about-narrative-copy about-narrative-copy-zh" lang="zh-CN">
              <p>
                我是 AI 降临派。<br />
                不是谨慎地"利用 AI 提效"，而是把 AI 当作自己思维和创造力的延伸，<br />
                毫无保留地拥抱这一代人独有的能力。
              </p>
              <p>
                但我不只关心技术。<br />
                一个产品怎么活下去，一个行业往哪里走，一笔钱该押在什么位置，<br />
                这些问题和"系统该怎么设计"一样让我着迷。<br />
                造东西和下注，在我眼里是同一件事。
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="about-narrative-copy about-narrative-copy-en" lang="en">
              <p>
                I'm all in on AI,<br />
                not cautiously "leveraging it for efficiency,"<br />
                but treating it as a genuine extension of how I think and create.
              </p>
              <p>
                But I'm not just about the tech.<br />
                How a product survives, where an industry is heading, where capital should go<br />
                <span class="about-narrative-nowrap">— these</span> questions fascinate me just as much as how to architect a system.<br />
                Building and betting, to me, are the same thing.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section class="about-skill reveal" aria-labelledby="about-skill-title">
          <h2
            class="about-skill-title is-flicker-paused"
            id="about-skill-title"
            data-flicker-text
            data-flicker-on-view
          >My Skill</h2>
          <div class="about-skill-content">
            <p class="about-skill-label">[ WHAT I DO ]</p>
            <div class="about-skill-copy" lang="zh-CN">
              <p>
                从 AI 视频生产线到校园社交产品，<br />
                我一直在做的事情是：用 AI 重新定义一个产品该怎么运转。
              </p>
              <p>
                从需求拆解、系统设计、pipeline 搭建，到部署上线和反复迭代，<br />
                我习惯一个人跑完从 0 到 1 的全程。<br />
                我知道哪些该交给 AI，哪些该自己决定。
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section projects-section" id="projects">
      <div class="container">
        <header class="projects-header reveal">
          <h2
            class="about-skill-title is-flicker-paused"
            data-flicker-text
            data-flicker-on-view
          >Projects</h2>
          <a class="projects-all-link" href="/projects/">查看全部项目 &rarr;</a>
        </header>

        <div class="projects-showcase" data-project-accordion>
          <div class="projects-media-column reveal">
            <div class="projects-media-window" data-project-media-window>
              <div class="projects-media-track" data-project-media-track>
                {projects.map((project, index) => (
                  <figure
                    class="project-media"
                    data-project-media-item
                    data-media-kind="placeholder"
                    aria-hidden={index === 0 ? "false" : "true"}
                  >
                    <div
                      class="project-media-placeholder"
                      role="img"
                      aria-label={`${project.data.title} 媒体占位`}
                    >
                      <span>{project.data.title}</span>
                      <small>MEDIA PLACEHOLDER<br />IMAGE / GIF / VIDEO</small>
                    </div>
                  </figure>
                ))}
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <ol class="project-accordion-list reveal">
            {projects.map((project, index) => {
              const slug = getEntrySlug(project);
              const triggerId = `project-${slug}-trigger`;
              const panelId = `project-${slug}-panel`;
              const isActive = index === 0;

              return (
                <li class:list={["project-accordion-item", { "is-active": isActive }]} data-project-item>
                  <button
                    class="project-accordion-trigger"
                    id={triggerId}
                    type="button"
                    aria-expanded={isActive ? "true" : "false"}
                    aria-controls={panelId}
                    data-project-trigger
                    data-project-index={index}
                  >
                    <span class="project-accordion-number">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}.</span>
                    <span class="project-accordion-title">{project.data.title}</span>
                  </button>
                  <div
                    class="project-accordion-panel"
                    id={panelId}
                    role="region"
                    aria-labelledby={triggerId}
                    aria-hidden={isActive ? "false" : "true"}
                    data-project-panel
                  >
                    <div class="project-accordion-panel-inner" data-project-panel-inner>
                      <div class="project-accordion-copy">
                        <p class="project-accordion-stack">{project.data.stack}</p>
                        <p class="project-accordion-summary">{project.data.summary}</p>
                      </div>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </li>
              );
            })}
          </ol>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="event-horizon-section" aria-label="Event horizon manifesto">
      <div class="event-horizon-inner">
        <p
          class="event-horizon-copy is-flicker-paused"
          data-flicker-text
          data-flicker-on-view
        >We are past the event horizon;<br />the takeoff has started.</p>
      </div>
      <canvas
        class="event-horizon-particles"
        data-event-horizon-field
        aria-hidden="true"
      ></canvas>
    </section>

    <section class="section thinking-section" id="thinking">
      <div class="container sec-grid thinking-layout">
        <header class="thinking-heading reveal">
          <h2
            class="thinking-title is-flicker-paused"
            data-flicker-text
            data-flicker-on-view
          >Thinking</h2>
          <a class="projects-all-link thinking-all-link" href="/blog/">查看全部文章 &rarr;</a>
        </header>
        <ul class="post-list thinking-list" aria-label="最近发布的 5 篇文章">
          {recentPosts.map((post) => (
            <li>
              <a class="post-row reveal" href={`/blog/${getEntrySlug(post)}/`}>
                <time class="post-date" datetime={post.data.pubDate.toISOString()}>{formatDate(post.data.pubDate)}</time>
                <div>
                  <h3 class="post-title">{post.data.title}</h3>
                  <p class="post-desc">{post.data.description}</p>
                </div>
                <span class="post-arr" aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
              </a>
            </li>
          ))}
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="contact">
      <div class="container sec-grid contact-layout">
        <aside class="sec-rail reveal">
          <h2 class="contact-title is-flicker-paused" data-flicker-text data-flicker-on-view>Contact</h2>
          <p class="about-skill-label contact-info-label">[ INFO ]</p>
          <p class="contact-intro">Open to AI products, writing, and good questions.</p>
        </aside>
        <dl class="social-list reveal reveal-delay" aria-label="社交与自媒体账号">
          <div>
            <dt>GitHub</dt>
            <dd><a href="https://github.com/nanzhi84" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">nanzhi84</a></dd>
          </div>
          <div><dt>微信公众号</dt><dd>釉蓝yoryon</dd></div>
          <div>
            <dt>小红书</dt>
            <dd><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/649ade98000000001001d1dc" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">釉蓝yoryon</a></dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt>抖音</dt>
            <dd><a href="https://www.douyin.com/user/MS4wLjABAAAAKYi5Z7LC-1B1YgY8kYdN2DrKqwtdTvZ4I0lodLekyOs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">釉蓝yoryon</a></dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script>
    import "../scripts/home-smooth-scroll";
  </script>
</SiteShell>
